{"id":227,"mal_id":227,"title":"FLCL","englishTitle":"FLCL","title_english":"FLCL","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":["Fooly Cooly","Furi Kuri"],"en":"FLCL","ja":"フリクリ"},"synopsis":"Naota Nandaba is an ordinary sixth grader living in a city where nothing amazing ever seems to happen. After his brother Tasuku leaves town to play baseball in America, Naota takes it upon himself to look after everything Tasuku left behind—from his top bunk bed to his ex-girlfriend Mamimi Samejima, who hasn't stopped clinging to Naota since Tasuku left. \n\nLittle does Naota know, however, that his mundane existence is on the verge of being changed forever: enter Haruko Haruhara, a Vespa-riding, bass guitar-wielding, pink-haired psychopath whose first encounter with Naota leaves him with tire tracks on his back and a giant horn on his head. Though all he wants is some peace and quiet, when Haruko takes up residence at his parents' home, Naota finds himself dragged into the heart of the greatest battle for supremacy that Earth—and quite possibly the entire universe—has ever seen.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","synopsis_es":"Naota Nandaba es una estudiante normal de sexto grado que vive en una ciudad donde nunca parece suceder nada sorprendente. Después de que su hermano Tasuku deja la ciudad para jugar béisbol en Estados Unidos, Naota se encarga de cuidar todo lo que Tasuku dejó atrás, desde su litera superior hasta su ex novia Mamimi Samejima, quien no ha dejado de aferrarse a Naota desde que Tasuku se fue. \n\nSin embargo, Naota no sabe que su existencia mundana está a punto de cambiar para siempre: llega Haruko Haruhara, un psicópata de pelo rosado, que conduce una Vespa y empuña un bajo, cuyo primer encuentro con Naota lo deja con huellas de neumáticos en la espalda y un cuerno gigante en la cabeza. Aunque todo lo que quiere es un poco de paz y tranquilidad, cuando Haruko se instala en la casa de sus padres, Naota se ve arrastrado al corazón de la mayor batalla por la supremacía que la Tierra (y muy posiblemente el universo entero) haya visto jamás.\n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]","type":"OVA","media_type":"ova","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1500,"average_episode_duration":1500,"startDate":"2000-04-26","start_date":"2000-04-26","endDate":"2001-03-16","end_date":"2001-03-16","season":"spring","year":2000,"start_season":{"year":2000,"season":"spring"},"episodes":6,"num_episodes":6,"score":8.04,"mean":8.04,"numListUsers":914345,"num_list_users":914345,"genres":[{"id":5,"name":"Avant Garde"},{"id":4,"name":"Comedy"},{"id":18,"name":"Mecha"},{"id":20,"name":"Parody"},{"id":40,"name":"Psychological"},{"id":24,"name":"Sci-Fi"},{"id":41,"name":"Suspense"}],"studios":[{"id":6,"name":"Gainax"},{"id":10,"name":"Production I.G"}],"pictures":[],"backdrop_url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/uiBb01nmHwyVTSILSMKJ4WIvijc.jpg","logo_url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vJMgkHdOBq6nH4XtuIBl2AZHQOK.png","tmdb_id":"5895","tmdb_updated_at":"2026-11-21T22:34:33.913Z","images":{"jpg":{"image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/7/77356.webp","large_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/7/77356l.webp"}},"main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/7/77356.webp","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/7/77356l.webp"},"trailer":{"images":{"maximum_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/7/77356l.webp"}},"broadcast":null,"rank":701,"popularity":235,"rating":"pg_13","num_scoring_users":473930,"nsfw":"white","source":"original","background":"The original property rights of the anime were sold by Gainax to Production I.G in 2015. \n\nThe anime placed third place for the Best Animation Film at the Fantasia Festival in 2003. In 2007 the anime got a nomination for Best Cast, and won the Best Comedy Series and the Best Short Series at the American Anime Awards show.","related_anime":[{"node":{"id":33010,"title":"FLCL Progressive","main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.ne